      "writtenOn": "2023-04-06T17:16:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that we probably need such check in native layer as well. But I think we do need this in framework to guard invalid address pass-down from app using BluetoothDevice. This represents the major app use case.\n\nFor adding the checks in other layers, I\u0027d rather put in separate CLs.",
      "parentUuid": "913c0d69_a8156821",
      "revId": "ca6a76aecf4ca1dc3b9aa4c07a5873aa3fdab084",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
